+// Unified earnings system: a client's earning records come from ONE of two
+// sources depending on how that client is billed (client.BulkBilling) —
+// never both, so nothing is double-counted.
+//   - Bulk-billing clients: each ga_payments row logged against them (lump
+//     sum / flat fee payments, not tied to a task).
+//   - Normal clients: each of their tasks, using that task's own Amount +
+//     PaymentStatus (set on the Tasks tab / client detail).
+// Both are normalized into the same {source, clientId, amount, date,
+// status, notes} shape below so the rest of the tab (range/status filters,
+// totals, the by-client breakdown, and the ledger) doesn't need to know or
+// care which kind of record it's looking at.
 
